          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "一、测试写速度"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "一测试写速度"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "time dd if=/dev/zero of=test.dbf bs=8k count=300000"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "原理：/dev/zero 是伪设备，只产生空字符流，不会产生 IO；IO 全部集中在 of（写入）侧，因此等价于测试磁盘写能力。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "输出示例："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "300000+0 records in\n300000+0 records out\n\nreal 0m36.669s\nuser 0m0.185s\nsys 0m9.340s"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "速度计算：8 * 300000 / 1024 / 36.669 = 63.916 M/s"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、测试读速度"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二测试读速度"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "time dd if=/dev/sda1 of=/dev/null bs=8k"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "原理：/dev/sda1 是物理分区，读取产生 IO；/dev/null 是黑洞伪设备，写入不产生 IO。IO 只发生在源设备上，等价于测试磁盘读能力。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "输出示例："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "448494+0 records in\n448494+0 records out\n\nreal 0m51.070s\nuser 0m0.054s\nsys 0m10.028s"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "速度计算：8 * 448494 / 1024 / 51.070 = 68.61 M/s"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "提示：count 越大、测试时间越长，结果越准确。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三、dd 参数深入：conv=fsync vs oflag=dsync/sync"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "三dd-参数深入convfsync-vs-oflagdsyncsync"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "背景：普通 dd 写文件时数据先进缓存就返回了，命令结束时数据可能并未真正落盘——结果不准确。要测\"真正写盘\"的速度，需用同步参数。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "参数含义对照"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "参数含义对照"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "align": [
          null,
          null,
          null
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "oflag=dsync"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Use synchronized I/O for data... forces a physical write of output data on each write"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "每次写都落盘才进行下一次写（模拟数据库插入，很慢）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "oflag=sync"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "likewise, but also for metadata"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "每次写同步数据和元数据"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "conv=fsync"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Synchronize output data and metadata just before finishing"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "命令结束前一次性同步数据+元数据到磁盘"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "关键差异"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "关键差异"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "oflag=dsync/sync：每写一次都同步一次 → 写 100 次就同步 100 次 → 最慢但最真实"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "conv=fsync：结束时才同步 → 写 100 次只在最后同步一次 → 比 dsync 快很多"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "实验验证"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "实验验证"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "配图内容描述（原图为两张 dd 测试结果终端截图）："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "图一（写 1 块）：oflag=sync 测得约 32.1 KB/s，conv=fsync 测得约 37.8 KB/s —— 只写一次时两者差别不大"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "图二（写 1000 块）：conv=fsync 明显比 oflag=dsync/sync 快很多 —— 印证了\"dsync 每写必同步、fsync 最后一次性同步\"的理解"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三种写法对比"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "三种写法对比"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 不准确：数据还在缓存，命令结束可能未真正落盘\ndd if=/dev/zero of=test bs=64k count=16k\n\n# 比较准确：结束前同步到磁盘\ndd if=/dev/zero of=test bs=64k count=16k conv=fsync\n\n# 最真实（最慢）：每写一次就落盘一次（能听到磁盘\"啪啪啪\"响）\ndd if=/dev/zero of=test bs=64k count=4k oflag=dsync\n# 或 oflag=sync"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "四、dd 如何绕过缓存（direct I/O）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "四dd-如何绕过缓存direct-io"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "iflag=direct,nonblock\noflag=direct,nonblock\n# 或\niflag=cio\noflag=cio"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "direct 模式：写入请求直接封装成 IO 指令发到磁盘，绕过文件系统缓存"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "非 direct 模式：数据先写系统缓存，立即认为 IO 成功，由操作系统决定何时落盘"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "测裸盘性能用 direct；测文件系统+缓存整体表现用普通模式。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
